OL,3,GNEWSACouncil calls for Oxford Street
OL,4,Aimpact assessment
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestminster City Council has written to
OL,7,Fthe government to demand a full
OL,8,Fenvironmental impact assessment, ahead
OL,9,Fof Sir Sadiq Khan's plans to
OL,10,Fpedestrianise Oxford Street.
OL,12,FThe central London borough, which is
OL,13,Fback under Conservative control after
OL,14,FMay's local elections, wants a detailed
OL,15,Fstudy into how traffic, noise and air
OL,16,Fquality in the surrounding
OL,17,Fneighbourhood would be impacted by the
OL,18,Fplans.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
