OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil calls for Oxford Street
OL,4,Aimpact assessment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe flagship shopping street is due to
OL,7,Fbe pedestrianised from Orchard Street
OL,8,Fto Great Portland Street after the
OL,9,Fmayor approved the proposals earlier
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,12,FTransport for London (TfL) said it was
OL,13,Fwaiting for the government to
OL,14,F"determine whether a full environmental
OL,15,Fimpact assessment is required".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
